        "over": "@rxtype:!wsma", "as": "i",
        "template": {
          "_comment": "Tune6 LO-lock fault verdicts (lo_lock_ok rules, per chain: yig1 always, the Gunn the rest frequency needs) and PLL context (receiverMonitor.c 597, 860, 885). Optional inputs default to not busy / Gunn on / no context.",
          "output": {
